sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant N as NetworkAgent
  participant G as ToolGateway
  participant OSS as OSS adapter
  participant T as Ticketing
  participant X as Proactive notifier
  C->>S: My internet is down
  S->>N: handle
  N->>G: network.check_outage
  G->>OSS: alarms for subscriber sector
  alt known outage
    OSS-->>N: alarm, cause, ETA
    N->>X: subscribe customer to updates (consent-aware)
    N->>G: ticket.create (service_down, P2)
    N-->>C: Verified outage details, ETA, SMS updates registered
    Note over X: On restore, notice is sent only to consented subscribers
  else no outage
    N->>G: network.run_diagnostics
    G->>OSS: line, signal, router checks
    N-->>C: Guided steps
    C->>S: Still not working
    N->>G: ticket.create
    N-->>C: Case reference, handover offered
  end
